# ── Vendored upstream (Phase 1) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The OpenTelemetry demo clone is large (~14 GB of images once run) and has its own
# git history — we vendor it but do NOT track it. OUR overrides (stage/splunk-otel/)
# and helper scripts (scripts/) stay tracked. Re-create the clone with the documented
# git clone in stage/README.md.
/stage/opentelemetry-demo/

# ── Scenario-harness runtime state (Phase 3) ────────────────────────────────────
# The agent overlay (rag_corpus / prompt_overlay / tool_fault triggers write here)
# and the harness state dir (saved feature-flag variants for deterministic reset)
# are runtime state recreated by `python -m control_plane play/reset` — not tracked.
/agent/_overlay/
/.harness/

# ── Build / compiled ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.o
*.a
*.so
*.dll
*.exe
